<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background-color: #16a34a;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo::after {
            content: '';
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
        }
        .otp-code {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #16a34a;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f0f9ff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px dashed #16a34a;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .warning {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo"></div>
        <h1>Verify Your Email Address</h1>
    </div>

    <p>Welcome to Pavodah! To complete your registration, please verify your email address using the code below:</p>

    <div class="otp-code">{{otpCode}}</div>

    <p>This verification code will expire in <strong>{{expiresInMinutes}} minutes</strong>.</p>

    <div class="warning">
        <strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you didn't create an account with Pavodah, please ignore this email. Your email address will not be used without verification.
    </div>

    <p>If you're having trouble with verification, you can request a new code or contact our support team.</p>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Best regards,<br>The Pavodah Team</p>
        <p>
            <a href="mailto:support@pavodah.com">support@pavodah.com</a><br>
            This is an automated email, please do not reply directly to this message.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
